nginx/certs/

# Convex generated client.
#
# These files MUST be committed. `convex codegen` requires a configured
# CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT, so CI and fresh clones cannot regenerate them, and the
# backend does not typecheck without them — the Convex CLI states this outright:
# "should be committed to the repo (your code won't typecheck without it!)".
# They contain no deployment URLs, keys, or secrets: only the module map and
# generic server/dataModel type scaffolding.
!backend/convex/_generated/
backend/.convex-tmp/
